Subject: [PATCH 07843/11362] [outer-loop] exp5834: dense-27B banks SAME live
 levels as 9B (2=2, identical per-game) -> generator switch NOT live-justified

Live 9B-vs-27B banked-levels A/B on 3090 CUDA (tu93/lp85/r11l), operator-directed
decider for the generator switch. Both arms mtp=False (CUDA build crashes on
--spec-type draft-mtp; MTP is output-preserving so speed-only). RESULT: 9B total=2
(1/1/0), 27B total=2 (1/1/0), every per-game delta 0, gate_clears=False.

The dense-27B is a ~5x better world-model INDUCER offline (exp5598 heldout 0.525 vs
0.100) but adds ZERO live levels here -- the SECOND live test after exp5722 (a 31B,
also 0) to show a bigger inducer does not convert to banked levels. Corroborates that
PERCEPTION, not induction, is the live binding constraint. Recommendation: keep the 9B
live generator (cheap, fits anything); the offline induction gain is not the lever.
adversarial_verify: 0 flagged.

